  "description": "Do-Young, a repeat student looking for a private tutor to help him get into a Korean university, decides to take lessons from his class president, who was introduced to him by a high school friend. However, Ha-Jin, the class president from the first semester who disliked him, joins as his tutor...\n\nDo-Young is constantly distracted by Ha-Jin, and Ha-Jin suggests canceling the tutoring. \n\n *\"If I misbehave again, you can hit me, punish me, or whatever you want!\"*\n\nDo-Young, unable to give up on the tutoring, says these urgent words, sending the class into a completely different direction.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
